msgid "Current section:"
msgstr "Section actuelle :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:372
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:776
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Aperçu"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:383
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:762
msgid "Address Book & On-Call"
msgstr "Carnet d'Adresses et Astreinte"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:388
msgid "E.164 Phone Numbers:"
msgstr "Numéros de Téléphone E.164 :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:388
msgid ""
"Store phone numbers with country code (+39...) to dial properly through "
"Asterisk ARI and send SMS."
msgstr ""
"Enregistrez les numéros avec le préfixe pays (+39...) pour appeler "
"correctement via Asterisk ARI et envoyer des SMS."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:389
msgid "On-Call Availability:"
msgstr "Disponibilité d'Astreinte :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:389
msgid ""
"Define start/end schedule intervals. Active contacts in the current "
"window are selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Définissez des plages horaires début/fin. Les contacts actifs dans la "
"fenêtre actuelle sont automatiquement sélectionnés."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:390
msgid "Escalation Priority:"
msgstr "Priorité d'Escalade :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:390
msgid ""
"Priority 0 is Primary Responder, 1 is Secondary, 2-3 Backup, 4 Duty "
"Supervisor."
msgstr ""
"La priorité 0 est l'intervenant principal, 1 le secondaire, 2-3 le "
"backup, 4 le superviseur de garde."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:391
msgid "CSV Operations:"
msgstr "Opérations CSV :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:391
msgid "Import or export entire contact databases at any time."
msgstr ""
"Importez ou exportez des bases de données de contacts entières à tout "
"moment."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:400
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:763
msgid "Scheduled Calls & Speech"
msgstr "Appels Programmés et Voix"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:405
msgid "Neural TTS Engine:"
msgstr "Moteur TTS Neuronal :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:405
msgid ""
"Message text is automatically synthesized into clear 8kHz/16kHz audio "
"using Silero Neural TTS."
msgstr ""
"Le texte du message est automatiquement synthétisé en audio clair 8 "
"kHz/16 kHz avec Silero Neural TTS."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:406
msgid "Audio Caching:"
msgstr "Mise en Cache Audio :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:406
msgid ""
"Synthesized audio is cached locally by message hash for instant zero-"
"latency playback."
msgstr ""
"L'audio synthétisé est mis en cache localement par empreinte du message "
"pour une lecture instantanée sans latence."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:407
msgid "Smart Recipient Picker:"
msgstr "Sélecteur Intelligent de Destinataires :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:407
msgid ""
"Choose a specific contact or select \"Use current On-call\" to resolve "
"on-duty responders."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un contact spécifique ou sélectionnez « Utiliser l'astreinte "
"actuelle » pour cibler les intervenants de garde."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:416
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:764
msgid "Managed Calls & DTMF"
msgstr "Appels Gérés et DTMF"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:421
msgid "Asterisk ARI Integration:"
msgstr "Intégration Asterisk ARI :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:421
msgid ""
"Channels are initiated via Asterisk REST Interface and placed in Stasis "
"bridge."
msgstr ""
"Les canaux sont initiés via l'interface REST Asterisk et placés dans le "
"pont Stasis."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:422
msgid "DTMF 4 Acknowledgment:"
msgstr "Acquittement DTMF 4 :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:422
msgid ""
"The recipient presses 4 to acknowledge the alert, marking it acknowledged"
" and terminating retries."
msgstr ""
"Le destinataire appuie sur 1 pour acquitter l'alerte, la marquant comme "
"confirmée et arrêtant les relances."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:423
msgid "Automatic Retries:"
msgstr "Nouvelles Tentatives Automatiques :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:423
msgid ""
"Unanswered calls automatically retry according to retry count and backoff"
" configuration."
msgstr ""
"Les appels sans réponse sont automatiquement retentés selon le compteur "
"et la configuration de temporisation."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:432
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:765
msgid "SMS & GSM Modems"
msgstr "SMS et Modems GSM"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:437
msgid "On-Premise Hardware Modems:"
msgstr "Modems Matériels Locaux :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:437
msgid ""
"SMS is dispatched directly via serial AT commands (/dev/ttyUSB) without "
"external dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Les SMS sont envoyés directement par commandes série AT (/dev/ttyUSB) "
"sans dépendances externes."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:438
msgid "Carrier Failover:"
msgstr "Basculement d'Opérateur :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:438
msgid ""
"If GSM signal is lost or modem fails, failover to secondary gateway (e.g."
" Twilio) triggers automatically."
msgstr ""
"Si le signal GSM est perdu ou que le modem échoue, le basculement vers la"
" passerelle secondaire (ex. Twilio) s'active automatiquement."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:439
msgid "Full Delivery Tracking:"
msgstr "Suivi Complet de Distribution :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:439
msgid ""
"View outbound SMS logs, delivery statuses, carrier metadata, and "
"timestamps in real time."
msgstr ""
"Consultez les journaux de SMS sortants, états de distribution, "
"métadonnées opérateur et horodatages en temps réel."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:448
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:766
msgid "PBX Events & Telephony Stream"
msgstr "Événements PBX et Flux Téléphonique"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:453
msgid "WebSocket Event Feed:"
msgstr "Flux d'Événements WebSocket :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:453
msgid ""
"Real-time feed of Asterisk ARI events including StasisStart, "
"ChannelDtmfReceived, and ChannelDestroyed."
msgstr ""
"Flux en temps réel des événements Asterisk ARI incluant StasisStart, "
"ChannelDtmfReceived et ChannelDestroyed."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:454
msgid "Troubleshooting Audits:"
msgstr "Audits de Dépannage :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:454
msgid ""
"Use the event timeline to diagnose call setup delays, SIP trunk "
"responses, and DTMF tones."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez la chronologie des événements pour diagnostiquer les délais "
"d'établissement d'appels, réponses de trunk SIP et tonalités DTMF."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:463
#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:761
msgid "Prometheus & Webhook Triggering"
msgstr "Prometheus et Déclencheurs Webhook"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:468
msgid "Alertmanager Receiver:"
msgstr "Récepteur Alertmanager :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:468
msgid "Configure Alertmanager to forward firing alerts to the webhook service:"
msgstr ""
"Configurez Alertmanager pour transférer les alertes déclenchées au "
"service webhook :"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:472
msgid ""
"Incoming alerts automatically resolve duty on-call contacts, synthesize "
"speech, and initiate emergency phone calls."
msgstr ""
"Les alertes entrantes déterminent automatiquement les contacts "
"d'astreinte en service, synthétisent la voix et lancent des appels "
"téléphoniques d'urgence."

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:481
msgid "Need to test right now?"
msgstr "Besoin de tester maintenant ?"

#: src/py_phone_caller_ui/templates/base.html:482
msgid "Send a live test call or SMS from the diagnostics console."
msgstr ""
"Envoyez un appel ou un SMS de test en direct depuis la console de "
